n November 1, 2007. A reissue titled \\\"Baby Baby\\\" was subsequently released on March 13, 2008. The tour Girls' Generation Asia Tour Into the New World was used to promote the album, alongside with music shows promotion before the tour, which started on December 19, 2009 in Olympic Fencing Gymnasium, Seoul, South Korea, ended in Taipei Arena, Taipei, Taiwan on October 17, 2010. \\\"Into the New World\\\" was initially released as Girls' Generation's debut single,\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0080-e397ecbbb7cf:d01\", \"text\": \"Girls' Generation (2006 album) Girls' Generation () is the self-titled debut album by South Korean girl group Girls' Generation. It was released by S.M. Entertainment on January 1, 2006. A reissue titled \\\"Baby Baby\\\" was subsequently released on March 13, 2008. The tour Girls' Generation Asia Tour Into the New World was used to promote the album, alongside with music shows promotion before the tour, which started on December 19, 2009 in Olympic Fencing Gymnasium, Seoul, South Korea, ended in Taipei Arena, Taipei, Taiwan on October 17, 2010. \\\"Into the New World\\\" was initially released as Girls' Generation's debut single.\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0080-e397ecbbb7cf:d02\", \"text\": \". Kyunghyang Shinmun ( in Korean ) . December 20 , 2022 . Archived from the original on December 20 , 2022 . Retrieved January 2 , 2023 . ^ `` CF 퀸으로 등극한 소녀시대 , 광고계도 접수 '' . The Korea Economic Daily ( in Korean ) . Archived from the original on March 6 , 2016 . Retrieved April 20 , 2016 . ^ 소녀시대 , 가요계-광고계 동시 석권 [ Girls Generation Takes Over Music Scene , and Now CF Scene ] ( in Korean ) . Acrofan . December 22 , 2010 . Archived from the original\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0080-e397ecbbb7cf:d03\", \"text\": \"2013 . ^ Brûlé , Tyler ( January 7 , 2011 ) . `` The secrets of my brilliant Korea '' . Financial Times . Archived from the original on December 24 , 2016 . ^ `` Girls ' Generation Make Cover of Nikkei Business '' . The Chosun Ilbo . October 2 , 2010 . Archived from the original on November 5 , 2013 . Retrieved November 26 , 2012 . ^ Forbes Korea Power Celebrity 40 sources : `` Korea 's Top Celebrities in 2011 '' . Forbes . March 31 , 2011 . Archived from the original\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"August 31, 2011\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"The self-titled debut album by Girls' Generation was released on August 31, 2011. This is a well-documented fact in K-pop history.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0080-e397ecbbb7cf:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0080-e397ecbbb7cf:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Girls' Generation (2007 album)\", \"scope\": \"Release date of the self-titled debut album\", \"claim\": \"The self-titled debut album by South Korean girl group Girls' Generation was released by S.M. Entertainment on November 1, 2007.\", \"answer\": \"November 1, 2007\", \"quote\": \"Girls' Generation (2007 album) Girls' Generation () is the self-titled debut album by South Korean girl group Girls' Generation. It was released by S.M. Entertainment on November 1, 2007.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0080-e397ecbbb7cf:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0080-e397ecbbb7cf:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Girls' Generation (2006 album)\", \"scope\": \"Release date of the self-titled debut album\", \"claim\": \"The self-titled debut album by South Korean girl group Girls' Generation was released by S.M. Entertainment on January 1, 2006.\", \"answer\": \"January 1, 2006\", \"quote\": \"Girls' Generation (2006 album) Girls' Generation () is the self-titled debut album by South Korean girl group Girls' Generation. It was released by S.M. Entertainment on January 1, 2006.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"fallible_previous_answer\": [\"November 1, 2007\"]}"
